Z||000004||Formula88||07-14-2001||12:53 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Standard:<BR><B>Well, weren't 15" wheels considered pretty cool in the 80's?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, considering the origial base Fiero came with 13" wheels, the 15" was pretty big by comparison.  Already a +2 upsize.  But, it does scream for 17".  That size just seems to fit the car best, IMO.||||reg||1
